# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 上 core.autocrlf 造成的
# "warning: LF will be replaced by CRLF" 噪音与幽灵 diff
#
# 本仓库以文档和 shell/JS 为主，统一按 LF 存储与检出。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制别做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
